<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday Babe! 💖</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #fdf4f6;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.8em;
            color: #ff6b81;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #ff6b81;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
            margin: 10px;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #ff4757;
        }
        .section {
            display: none;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Happy Birthday Babe! 🎉</h1>
        <p>I made this little site just to remind you how special you are to me!</p>

        <button class="button" onclick="toggle('love')">Things I Love About You 💕</button>
        <button class="button" onclick="toggle('wish')">My Birthday Wishes 🌟</button>

        <div id="love" class="section">
            <h2>Things I Love About You 💖</h2>
            <ul style="text-align:left;">
                <li>Your smile and how it lights up my day</li>
                <li>Your humor—always making me laugh</li>
                <li>The way you care deeply about those around you</li>
                <li>Your endless patience and kindness</li>
                <li>How supportive you are with my dreams</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="wish" class="section">
            <h2>My Birthday Wishes for You 🌟</h2>
            <p>I hope this year brings you so much joy, love, success, and happiness. You're truly incredible, and I'm grateful every single day to have you in my life. Happy Birthday, my love. Here's to many more together! 🥂💕</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function toggle(id) {
            const el = document.getElementById(id);
            if(el.style.display === 'none' || el.style.display === ''){
                el.style.display = 'block';
            } else {
                el.style.display = 'none';
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
